Z||000009||bHooper||12-23-1999||09:09 AM||||As for "classic" designation, in North Carolina... I bought a '66 Mustang Converitble in 1983 and was able to have it insured as a "classic driver".  Meaning it would only have xxxx amount of mile put on it  in any givin year.  I have heard that the time line for this is either 10 or 15 years.  Either way, all AMC Pacers and Gremlins are NOW classics  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
